 "summary": "The Granite Auditorium (Fa\u00e7ade) in real LEGO parts: the curved back wall of a 1920s college auditorium on a shallow base, in rough-faced gray granite with warm tan stones mixed in. Paired pilasters divide the curve into three bays under a cornice and a tall parapet, with two plain tablets high up, a narrow door under a small gabled hood, and ivy climbing over much of it. At either end stands a square pavilion: an arched louvered window over a white sash and a glass door on one, a raised white door with its steel stair and rail on the other. In front, a lawn, a path to both doors, shrubs, two slender trees and two students. The back is a plain wall, so it sits neatly on a shelf or against a wall.",
